然后就是那种东拼西凑起来的 Django 再加上一个你知道的 Cython 运行时的分支
And it was this like kind of hack together Django and then like a fork of, you know, the Cython runtime.

350
00:15:34,490 --> 00:15:36,130
几乎什么都不太好用
And just nothing really worked.

351
00:15:36,450 --> 00:15:37,370
所以我来到 Instagram 之后
And so I came to Instagram.

352
00:15:37,710 --> 00:15:38,670
加入了实验室团队
I joined the labs team,

353
00:15:38,930 --> 00:15:40,010
就是在日本这边的那个
you know, in Japan.

354
