目标是为 Instagram 找到下一个大项目
And the idea was to find the next big thing for Instagram.

355
00:15:42,930 --> 00:15:43,730
我们尝试了不少东西
We tried some stuff.

356
00:15:43,850 --> 00:15:48,070
但我很快意识到，在这套技术栈上我完全发挥不出效率
But what I very quickly realized is that I was just not effective at working on the stack

357
00:15:48,070 --> 00:15:49,610
因为这栈实在太糟糕了
because it was such a terrible stack.

358
00:15:49,610 --> 00:15:55,330
所以我干脆转去做开发基础设施，因为这东西必须得修
And so I just went and started working on DevInfra because we needed to fix it.

359
