也是当初把我招进 Anthropic 的那个人
And he's actually, he's the person that hired me to Anthropic.

1282
00:54:58,470 --> 00:55:00,610
我们最后想出了用权限弹窗来解决这个问题
We just came up with permission prompts as the way to do this.

1283
00:55:01,110 --> 00:55:03,030
如果你拿不准 就问人类
If you're not sure, just ask the human,

1284
00:55:03,410 --> 00:55:04,530
由他们来做决定
and they can decide.

1285
